{
  "key": 19878,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiThankYouFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: Heh?\n",
        "You came to save me?\r",
        "Thank you. But, I came here of my\n",
        "own free will.\r",
        "I came to calm the spirit of\n",
        "Cubone’s mother.\r",
        "I think Marowak’s spirit has\n",
        "finally left us.\r",
        "I must thank you for your kind\n",
        "concern.\r",
        "Follow me to my home, Pokémon\n",
        "House, at the foot of this tower."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "What do you want?\n",
        "Why are you here?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle",
      "en_US": "I’m not going to forget this!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "This old guy marched right up to\n",
        "our Hideout.\r",
        "Then, he starts ranting about how\n",
        "Team Rocket’s abusing Pokémon.\r",
        "So, we’re just talking it over as\n",
        "adults."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon are only good for making\n",
        "money. Why not use them?\r",
        "You stay out of our business!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Intro",
      "en_US": "You’re not saving anyone, kid!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle",
      "en_US": "You’re not getting away with this!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0891_CV_CANVAS_POKEMON_TOWER_7F_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
